(*---
description: Explores init let and next unchanged_tuple with check action_constraint.
ref: tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getInitStates; tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getNextStates
features:
  - state-space
outcome: any
config: |
  INIT Init
  NEXT Next
  ACTION_CONSTRAINT Con
---*)
---- MODULE space_let__unchanged_tuple__action_constraint ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == LET v == 1 IN x = v /\ y = v
Next == UNCHANGED <<x, y>>
Con == x' = x
====

